TitanOS – Third-Party Components
================================

TitanOS's own code is licensed under FSL-1.1-ALv2 (see LICENSE.md).
The system image also contains third-party software that keeps its own
license. This repository file is an overview, not the complete inventory.
scripts/third-party-licenses.py generates the exact versioned inventory
from the built Go binary, installed npm dependencies (including build tools
and fonts), and the Debian package database of each image. That generated
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES is shown under "Settings > About". Original notices and
components.json are in /usr/share/titanos/ and the release's licenses.tar.gz;
the release's sources.txt links the exact upstream package versions.

